<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech c.bank sets 13-wk bill auction, max 13.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech c.bank sets 13-wk bill auction, max 13.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank has set a Dutch auction of eight billion crowns in 13-week liquidity bills for Thursday.</p>
<p>Maximum yield on bids in the auction was set at 13.5 percent and bids are due at the central bank by 1200 local time (1100 gmt) on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Prague newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
